🇮🇱 ⚔️ 🇵🇸 Even though the court banned the implementation of the "Crocodiles" project, Israel's Minister of Environmental Protection, Idit Silman, has ordered the continuation of preparations for deploying crocodiles around the prison with Palestinians.

Silman, along with the Minister of National Security, Itamar Ben-Gvir, is the greatest supporter of this inhumane solution.

